manual.godofthings.super_fusion_card:
[Super Fusion Card] An all-in-one machine refit tool ported from Mekanism-Card. One card covers four operations:
- Tier install: raises a machine all the way to the tier recorded on the card (consumes the matching installers);
- Install upgrades: syncs the recorded upgrade profile onto the target machine, filling or trimming counts (surplus returns to your inventory);
- Memory copy / paste: copies a machine's config (upgrades, side settings and so on) and pastes it onto machines of the same kind;
- Full mode: raises the tier first, then pastes upgrades and config in one go.
[Controls] Right-click a machine to run the current mode; sneak-right-click a machine to copy its config; sneak-right-click air to clear the card; left-click air to open the settings screen; sneak-left-click air to cycle modes; middle-click a machine to fill every upgrade at once; hold the Super Fusion Card batch selection key (unbound by default, set it under the God of Things category) and left-click two corners to run the current mode over that box.
[Material networks] Put the card into an ME wireless access point and shift-right-click to bind it to the AE network; sneak-right-click a QIO dashboard to bind a QIO frequency. Once bound, upgrade and installer materials can be pulled straight from those networks.
[Soft dependency] This item is only registered when Mekanism is installed; with Mekanism Extras or EvolvedMekanism present it automatically supports the higher tiers those mods inject.
